From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000002 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] Add LoongArch sources to the gyp source list

Upstream's libyuv.gypi omits the LoongArch LSX/LASX implementation
files. Add rotate_lsx.cc, row_lasx.cc, row_lsx.cc and scale_lsx.cc so
the gyp-driven build (as used by UXP) compiles them; they remain
no-ops on non-LoongArch targets because their contents are guarded by
the LIBYUV_LSX/LIBYUV_LASX feature defines.
diff --git a/libyuv.gypi b/libyuv.gypi
index 48936aa..25641ea 100644
--- a/libyuv.gypi
+++ b/libyuv.gypi
@@ -57,6 +57,7 @@
       'source/rotate_argb.cc',
       'source/rotate_common.cc',
       'source/rotate_gcc.cc',
+      'source/rotate_lsx.cc',
       'source/rotate_msa.cc',
       'source/rotate_neon.cc',
       'source/rotate_neon64.cc',
@@ -64,6 +65,8 @@
       'source/row_any.cc',
       'source/row_common.cc',
       'source/row_gcc.cc',
+      'source/row_lasx.cc',
+      'source/row_lsx.cc',
       'source/row_msa.cc',
       'source/row_neon.cc',
       'source/row_neon64.cc',
@@ -73,6 +76,7 @@
       'source/scale_argb.cc',
       'source/scale_common.cc',
       'source/scale_gcc.cc',
+      'source/scale_lsx.cc',
       'source/scale_msa.cc',
       'source/scale_neon.cc',
       'source/scale_neon64.cc',
